---
// Public design options. Budget sizing is not commissioned or OEM-confirmed capacity.
const loops = [
 {id:'warm',label:'Loop A · Server liquid circuit',title:'Liquid cooling, close to the chip.',intro:'The proposed Supermicro systems require direct liquid cooling. Coolant distribution units isolate and control the server circuit. New and warranted refurbished mechanical plant are being compared; separate dry coolers may be added later for energy savings.',cards:[['Liquid-cooled racks','Coolant, connections and flow follow the selected OEM requirements.'],['CDU isolation','Controlled server coolant, separate from facility water.'],['Mechanical plant','New or warranted refurbished equipment; optional staged dry coolers.']],supply:'Supply to the load',return:'Warmer return to the plant'},
 {id:'chilled',label:'Loop B · Residual-air cooling option',title:'Cool the heat that stays in the room.',intro:'The selected building has no working air conditioning. All residual-server, network and room cooling must be new. Active rear-door heat exchangers on a chilled circuit are one option; conventional room cooling is being priced as an alternative.',cards:[['Rear doors or room cooling','Choose the complete air-cooling solution after heat-load review.'],['Separate temperature control','The water-circuit option needs appropriate pumps, buffering and control.'],['Shared plant option','Separately controlled circuits may share a modular plant.']],supply:'Supply to the air-cooling load',return:'Warmer return to the plant'}
];
---
<section id="thermal" class="thermal" aria-labelledby="thermal-heading">
 <p class="thermal__kicker">[THERMAL ARCHITECTURE · DESIGN INTENT]</p>
 <h2 id="thermal-heading">Liquid cooling for the servers.<br/> Air cooling for the rest.</h2>
 <p class="thermal__intro">The eight-system B300 proposal is consolidated in one building, with all-new cooling. The concept separates server-liquid and residual-air duties; the water-circuit option is shown below. Quotes and engineering will determine whether a shared plant, rear doors or conventional room cooling provides the complete solution.</p>
 <div class="thermal__facts">
  <div><strong>All-new cooling</strong><span>No existing air-conditioning capacity is credited.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Dry rejection goal</strong><span>No cooling towers or evaporative pads are planned.</span></div>
  <div><strong>N+1 target</strong><span>Component redundancy and complete failure paths need validation.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Complete installed cost</strong><span>Compare equipment, piping, power, controls and commissioning together.</span></div>
 </div>
 <div class="thermal__lanes">
 {loops.map(loop=><article class:list={['thermal__lane',`thermal__lane--${loop.id}`]} aria-labelledby={`thermal-${loop.id}`}>
  <p class="thermal__kicker">[{loop.label}]</p><h3 id={`thermal-${loop.id}`}>{loop.title}</h3>
  <div class="thermal__flow"><div class="thermal__flow-label"><span>ONE BUILDING · A OR C ALLOCATION PENDING</span><span>OUTDOOR EQUIPMENT · LOCATION PENDING</span></div>
   <div class="thermal__nodes">{loop.cards.map(([title,body])=><div><strong>{title}</strong><span>{body}</span></div>)}</div>
   <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 90" role="img" aria-label={`${loop.label}: supply flows from the outdoor plant toward the load; warmer fluid returns to the plant. Schematic only, not a piping design.`}>
    <defs><marker id={`${loop.id}-supply`} markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="5" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8Z" class="thermal__supply-fill"/></marker><marker id={`${loop.id}-return`} markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="5" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8Z" class="thermal__return-fill"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M885 27H525H120" class="thermal__supply" marker-end={`url(#${loop.id}-supply)`}/><path d="M120 62H525H885" class="thermal__return" marker-end={`url(#${loop.id}-return)`}/><path d="M660 0V90" class="thermal__wall"/>
   </svg><div class="thermal__legend"><span class="thermal__legend-supply">← {loop.supply}</span><span class="thermal__legend-return">{loop.return} →</span></div>
  </div><p>{loop.intro}</p>
 </article>)}
 </div>
 <div class="thermal__notes"><div><h3>Economizers are an option, not a shortcut.</h3><p>Separate dry coolers may be staged when their energy savings justify the investment. Hot-weather duty still needs mechanical coverage. Closed circuits need initial filling, servicing and possible coolant replacement.</p></div><div><h3>Designed around the selected servers.</h3><p>Water temperature, dew-point control, heat capture, room cooling and peak-weather performance require an OEM-compatible mechanical design. The two circuits may share a rejection plant; their presence does not prescribe four chillers or establish installed capacity.</p></div></div>
 <p class="thermal__concession">DESIGN INTENT · MECHANICAL REVIEW AND EQUIPMENT SELECTIONS PENDING · NOT INSTALLED CAPACITY OR A PERFORMANCE GUARANTEE</p>
 <a class="btn" href="/contact#reserve-enquiry">Discuss the cooling requirements <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</section>
<style>
.thermal{--warm:#efb99c;--warm-return:#c6b6e9;--ice:#bce9eb;--sky:#85bfee;margin-block:3rem;padding:clamp(22px,4vw,54px);border:1px dashed #afc7b86b;border-radius:18px;background:#122d23;color:#eef1ef;scroll-margin-top:100px}.thermal .thermal__kicker{font:0.875rem/1.6 var(--f-mono);letter-spacing:.045em;color:var(--c-signal);margin:0 0 20px}.thermal h2{font-family:var(--f-display);font-size:clamp(2rem,3.8vw,3.8rem);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:var(--ls-display);max-width:28ch;margin:0 0 24px}.thermal h3{font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2vw,1.8rem);line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 16px}.thermal p{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:85ch;color:#d2dfd7}.thermal__facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin:30px 0}.thermal__facts>div{padding:20px;border:1px dashed #719581;min-width:0}.thermal__facts strong,.thermal__facts span,.thermal__nodes strong,.thermal__nodes span{display:block}.thermal__facts strong{font-size:1.1rem;color:#eaf3ed}.thermal__facts span{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:9px;color:#b7cdbf}.thermal__lanes{display:grid;gap:24px}.thermal__lane{padding:24px;border:1px dashed #789384;border-radius:10px;min-width:0}.thermal__flow-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font:.75rem/1.6 var(--f-mono);color:#bcd0c3;margin:24px 0 16px}.thermal__flow-label>span:last-child{text-align:right}.thermal__nodes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.thermal__nodes>div{padding:18px;border:1px dashed #739682;background:#0a2119;min-width:0}.thermal__nodes strong{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.4}.thermal__nodes span{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:10px;color:#bed2c5}.thermal__flow svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;min-height:65px}.thermal__supply,.thermal__return{fill:none;stroke-width:3}.thermal__supply{stroke:var(--warm)}.thermal__return{stroke:var(--warm-return)}.thermal__supply-fill{fill:var(--warm)}.thermal__return-fill{fill:var(--warm-return)}.thermal__lane--chilled{--warm:var(--ice);--warm-return:var(--sky)}.thermal__wall{fill:none;stroke:#92a79a;stroke-width:2;stroke-dasharray:5 6}.thermal__legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 28px;font-size:.875rem}.thermal__legend-supply{color:var(--warm)}.thermal__legend-return{color:var(--warm-return)}.thermal__notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px;margin-top:30px}.thermal .thermal__concession{font:.75rem/1.8 var(--f-mono);color:#b6cebf;max-width:none;margin:26px 0}.thermal .btn{display:inline-flex;gap:15px;align-items:center;min-height:48px;padding:13px 20px;background:var(--c-signal);color:#102b1c;text-decoration:none;border-radius:28px;font-size:1rem}.thermal a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffe093;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:850px){.thermal__facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.thermal__notes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.thermal__lane{padding:18px}}@media(max-width:580px){.thermal__facts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.thermal__nodes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.thermal__flow-label{display:block}.thermal__flow-label span{display:block;margin:8px 0}.thermal__flow-label>span:last-child{text-align:left}.thermal__flow svg{display:none}.thermal__nodes>div+div:before{content:'↕  closed supply / return';display:block;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--warm);margin-bottom:12px}.thermal__legend{margin-top:16px}.thermal h2 br{display:none}}@media print{.thermal{background:#fff;color:#141414}.thermal p,.thermal h3,.thermal strong,.thermal span{color:#141414!important}.thermal .btn{display:none}.thermal__nodes>div{background:#fff}}
</style>
